2406.12045&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[79] OSWorld 2.0（作者与完整标题待补）. arXiv 2606.29537, 2026-06（预印本，会议未确认）. &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.29537&quot;&gt;https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.29537&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[80] Rosset et al. The Art of Building Verifiers for Computer Use Agents. arXiv 2604.06240, 2026-04（预印本，会议未确认）. &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.06240&quot;&gt;https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.06240&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[81] Zhu et al. Establishing Best Practices for Building Rigorous Agentic Benchmarks (ABC). NeurIPS 2025 (Datasets &amp;amp; Benchmarks). &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.02825&quot;&gt;https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.02825&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[82] Kapoor et al. Holistic Agent Leaderboard (HAL). ICLR 2026. &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.11977&quot;&gt;https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.11977&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[83] Xue et al. An Illusion of Progress? Assessing the Current State of Web Agents (Online-Mind2Web / WebJudge). COLM 2025. &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.01382&quot;&gt;https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.01382&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[84] Chae et al. Web-Shepherd: Advancing PRMs for Reinforcing Web Agents. NeurIPS 2025. &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.15277&quot;&gt;https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.15277&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[85] Cemri et al. Why Do Multi-Agent LLM Systems Fail? (MAST). NeurIPS 2025. &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.13657&quot;&gt;https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.13657&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[86] Khalifa et al. Process Reward Models That Think (ThinkPRM). ICML 2026. &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.16828&quot;&gt;https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.16828&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[87] Hsiao. Rethinking Verbalized Confidence for LLM-as-a-Judge. arXiv 2609.10996, 2026-09（预印本，会议未确认）. &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.10996&quot;&gt;https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.10996&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;[88] Li et al. WebDevJudge: Evaluating (M)LLMs as Critiques for Web Development Quality. arXiv 2510.18560（预印本，会议未确认）. &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.18560&quot;&gt;https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.18560&lt;/a&gt;" vertex="1">
